WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.170
Kumi consults Mitsuki about love,

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.000
believing that Mitsuki is
an expert on love.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.000
I come up with the idea of
writing him a love letter,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.140
but he ends up thinking
it's from Mitsuki!

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.370
What do we do?!

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:14.040
Mitsuki encourages Kumi to
tell the boy how she feels,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.700
and Kumi ends up confessing
her love to him!

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.140
Maybe Mitsuki really is
an expert on love!

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.840
So, I wonder what's going to
happen today...

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.640
Got that?

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:29.600
Yes...

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.700
Have a nice day.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.360
Everybody is out now.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:21.000
Mitsuki and Takuto are at the event
for the release of the second single.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.160
I'm so bored!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.260
Oh well, I guess I'll watch some TV!

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.500
<i>There! Completely white in no time!</i>

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:29.560
<i>- Wow!</i>
<i>- Wow!</i>

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:32.530
<i>Put one cup of rice wine into the pan</i>
<i>and cook for 30 minutes.</i>

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.160
How boring!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.860
What? Did it break?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.360
W-What is this?!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.200
W-What is this?!

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.800
What in the world is going on?!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.230
Could it be a ghost?

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.700
How rude!
Who do you think I am?

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.730
I am Miss Meroko, a Death Spirit
fearsome enough to silence a crying child!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.600
There!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.830
Y-You're so cruel.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.400
No way! Is it really a ghost?!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.960
No, he's a Death Spirit.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.100
That voice... Could it be?

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.000
I-Izumi?!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.400
It's been a long time, Mero!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:46.430
<i>- W-Why did he show up</i>
- Hey, is my nose squashed?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.230
<i>- all of a sudden?</i>
- No, I think it actually got bigger.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.130
I-Izumi, why are you here
in the human world?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.860
Should I not have come?

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:58.160
I'm not going to be a nuisance...am I?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.730
O-Of course not!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.260
It's absurd to think that
you'll be a nuisance!

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.900
Of course,
I'm really glad to see you!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.260
Yeah, aren't you?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:11.860
Oh yes, this is Jonathan,
who became my partner after you, Mero.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.100
Nice to meet you.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.800
Nice to meet you.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.630
Hey, there is this rumor...

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:23.800
A rumor that Green Onion Ramen
is using Death Spirit powers

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.600
to become friends
with a human child.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:27.860
What?!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.630
The Division Chief told us
to go investigate.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.260
If the rumor is true,
it will be a serious problem.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:38.160
With a very scary punishment.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.630
Punishment?!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.960
Izumi is such a sadist.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.660
That's because you picked on Mero.

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:51.930
Sorry.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:56.730
I'm the only one who's allowed
to pick on Mero. Right?

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.800
So, is the rumor true?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:00.860
Is it true?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.030
Th-That's nonsense!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:06.360
Of course we wouldn't do that.
We are Death Spirits!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:07.860
I thought so.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.460
Yup!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.160
That's fine if that's the case.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.630
By the way, where is Takuto?

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.260
And was it Mitsuki Koyama?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.560
Where is the girl you're in charge of?

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.960
T-Takuto is out right now.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.800
He's watching over Mitsuki.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.300
See, we're just doing our job.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.160
Mero, why aren't you with him?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.660
Aren't you madly in love with Takuto?

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.200
What? W-Well...

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.300
Hey, what is this?

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.400
There are so many buttons!

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:42.230
<i>The second single is</i>
<i>a very good song.</i>

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.600
<i>I'd love it if everybody could make it</i>
<i>to today's concert for the new single!</i>

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.460
<i>Everybody, please come to</i>
<i>Full Moon's live concert</i>

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.500
<i>to hear her new single</i>
<i>at Nasu Aquatic Stage</i>

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.830
<i>- at two o'clock in the afternoon.</i>
- T-Television!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.830
Right now,
I like TV more than Takuto!

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:56.860
Oh yeah?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.330
<i>I feel like I'm dead.</i>

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:04.460
Hey, hey, there's not much to
do by staying here

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:07.200
so let's go out and play until
Takuto comes back.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.460
Okay.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:12.800
<i>Great! I can trick them and</i>
<i>somehow get them to go back!</i>

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.730
Hey, is there anywhere you want to go?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.600
Yeah.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.560
That Full Moon we just saw on TV...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.260
I want to go to her
new single release concert.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.760
<i>Why there, of all places?!</i>

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.530
<i>A-Anyhow, I have to get</i>
<i>in touch with Takuto.</i>

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.360
Can you wait here a little bit?

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:39.060
It's the first time in a while that I'll be
going out with Izumi, so I want to dress up.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.660
Oh, I'm so excited.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.660
What?! Izumi is here?!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.700
And not only that, he came
to investigate us?!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.760
<i>Yeah! What should I do?</i>

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:04.730
At any rate, all we can do is to
deceive him and buy some time

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.800
<i>until the concert for</i>
<i>the new single is over! Got it?!</i>

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.700
Okay... I'll try my best.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.030
What do you mean, "I'll try my best"?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.430
U-Umm... My make-up.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.300
Yes, I tried my best with my make-up.

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.300
How do I look?

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.160
Dang it, Izumi!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.800
Of course he comes
at a bad time!

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.160
I want to meet Izumi!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.000
Huh?

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.830
Isn't he a friend of
yours and Meroko's?

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.200
I have to say hello.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:33.060
No! There's no need for that!

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.830
Izumi is the most sadistic among
the Death Spirits

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.900
and basically lives to pick on others.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:42.230
If he learns that you not only see
the appearance of Death Spirits

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.200
but can also talk to us...

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.460
<i>Here, here.</i>

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.600
<i>No!</i>

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:51.630
No, more than that, if he finds out
that I help you by using my powers,

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.760
he'll immediately report it to
the Division Chief,

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:58.100
and both Meroko and I will get punished
and assigned to someone else.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.130
What?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.230
I'm going to hide while Izumi is around.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.030
Okay.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.100
Don't worry. Just be patient until
the new single release concert is over.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:11.230
Make sure to pretend that
you can't see us.

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.730
Okay, I understand.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.160
Wow, there are so many people.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.860
Full Moon is quite popular, huh?

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.700
I-I guess so.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.530
<i>I just have to try to get them</i>
<i>as far away as possible.</i>

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.760
Hey, Full Moon is over there.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.630
What? Where?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:35.860
Follow me.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.130
Full Moon!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.460
Machi and Lisa have arrived.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.030
Hello!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.960
How are you doing, Full Moon?

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.530
Mero, did you mean to say "here"
when you said "over there"?

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.530
That's strange!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.030
<i>Takuto was saying those things,</i>

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.200
<i>but I wonder if</i>
<i>he's that scary of a person.</i>

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.360
Something wrong, Full Moon?

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.960
Oh? Oh, no.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.230
Then, I'll begin your make-up now.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.200
Yes. Thank you.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:16.100
<i>Yes, I know. Pretend not to see,</i>
<i>pretend not to see.</i>

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.730
Isn't she cuter in person
than on TV?

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.560
Do you think so?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.730
To me, Mero is so much cuter.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.430
Oh... She has a nose hair sticking out.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.730
Oh, is something wrong?

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.330
I-It's just a little itchy.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.230
Full Moon's surprisingly funny.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.330
Really.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.460
<i>Okay! Thank you for coming today to</i>
<i>Full Moon's second single release concert!</i>

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:47.500
<i>Please enjoy</i>
<i>the new world of Full Moon!</i>

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.630
All right, it's finally show time.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.860
Go break a leg!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:51.860
Yes!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.160
<i>Now, it's what everybody</i>
<i>has been waiting for.</i>

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.730
<i>Here's Full Moon!</i>

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.800
Help me!

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:16.830
Mitsuki!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:21.960
Hold on!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:22.830
Takuto!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.360
Are you okay?

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:38.630
Are you hurt?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.360
<i>I'm so sorry! The horse seems to</i>
<i>have been in a bad mood!</i>

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:47.260
Don't worry!
Full Moon seems to be fine.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.430
Thank goodness you're not hurt.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:50.560
Yeah.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.930
The knight on a white horse,
Takuto, arrives, eh?

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.800
Izumi! What were you thinking?!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.430
Well, I guess I was just
playing around.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.300
Stop messing around!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.760
Why are you so angry?

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.700
It shouldn't matter to you
what happens to Full Moon.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:17.900
Hey, since you're here, does that mean
that girl named Mitsuki is around here too?

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.300
Huh? What's wrong?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.700
Where is she?
I want to meet her!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.560
Th-That's...

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.400
<i>Takuto is in trouble!</i>

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.060
Oh yeah!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:36.560
Ms. Oshige, Dr. Wakaoji,
I have something to ask.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:40.930
What?!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.500
Now, let me meet Mitsuki.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.700
I want to meet her!

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.100
Come to think of it,
isn't the name "Mitsuki"

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:06.800
written with the Chinese characters
meaning "full moon"?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.460
That's just like "Full Moon" the singer.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.230
What a funny coincidence.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:15.630
Wait, Full Moon!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.500
Wait!

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:24.360
Oh? Are they playing tag?
Looks like fun.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.130
Darn it, Jonathan.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.660
Takuto! We should go too!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:28.500
Yeah.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.400
Takuto! Meroko!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.630
Change me back to Mitsuki
while we have this chance!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.800
Mitsuki!

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:36.060
Then that's...

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:46.860
What?

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.700
They're gone.

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.760
Oh well. Let's go back to Mero.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.300
Was that long enough?

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.730
We're back.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:03.760
How was it?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.800
We lost them.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:07.200
Oh, yeah?

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.930
You came just in time!
I'll introduce her!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:14.960
This is Mitsuki Koyama that we,
Green Onion Ramen, are in charge of.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.930
Oh, so this is Mitsuki?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.360
She's pretty cute!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.730
Stop it, Izumi!

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:30.000
Yeah, you're going to
scare Mitsuki!

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:34.230
Why? It's not as if
she can see us, right?

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.400
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.960
Izumi, these two probably
like this girl a lot.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.200
I see.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.960
Oh yeah,
speaking of liking, Mero,

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.800
how many times have you
confessed your love to Takuto?

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.130
If I recall, it was over 30 times
last time I heard.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.000
It doesn't matter
how many times I do it!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.430
I love that.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:14:00.430
Laughing scornfully
while watching your face

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:03.930
bearing humiliation and anger
is one of my tiny joys.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.460
I hate you!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.530
You have such a short temper, Mero.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:12.330
That's enough, Izumi!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:17.300
Meroko is my important partner!
Stop making fun of her so much!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:18.730
Takuto...

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:24.000
Oh? But isn't it bad for you to
be so worried about Meroko?

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:28.160
If you fail this time,
the Division Chief might really get angry!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:29.660
<i>Fail?</i>

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.630
Because you haven't recovered
a single soul up to now.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.030
Right, good-for-nothing Takuto?

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:39.860
<i>Takuto...</i>

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.860
Takuto is a late bloomer!

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.460
He'll soon become a great Death Spirit!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:51.730
Well, I'll stop the teasing here for
the sake of my dear Mero's words.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:56.200
<i>Dummy!</i>

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.860
Oh, by the way, Mitsuki is here
but I wonder where Full Moon is.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.460
Sh-She's probably somewhere near here!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.460
Mero-Mero Change!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.960
Now, I have to make this work!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.860
How long are they going to play tag?

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:26.930
Huh?

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.060
There she is!

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:32.560
Gosh, how far did Ms. Oshige
and Dr. Wakaoji go?

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.630
<i>Is it Meroko?</i>

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:37.530
Oh, so you're Mitsuki?

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:38.230
Huh?

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:41.000
Thank you for the flowers!
I was very happy!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.160
Y-You're welcome.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.460
Izumi, it's Full Moon.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.260
<i>Everybody,</i>
<i>just a little bit longer.</i>

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:54.200
<i>Please wait a little longer.</i>
<i>Okay? Okay?</i>

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:57.800
Thanks for waiting! Mitsuki!
Did it work? Huh?

00:15:58.730 --> 00:15:59.400
Huh?

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.700
- W-Why are there two Mitsukis—
- Ms. Oshige!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:09.430
M-Mitsuki, how was it?
Were you able to talk to Full Moon?

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.400
Oh? Umm... Yes, just a little bit.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:14.130
All right, that's great.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.230
Oh, there you guys are.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.630
Both Mr. Oji and Full Moon,
please hurry.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.700
We can't make the crowd
wait any longer.

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:21.730
I understand!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.860
Tell them we'll be going
to the stage now.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:24.900
Yes, sir!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.730
Now, Full Moon.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.730
What?! B-But I'm...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.260
Now, quick.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.760
B-But...

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.730
This is great!

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:39.430
<i>What are they going to do?</i>
<i>Meroko can't sing the new single.</i>

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:44.100
Huh? Only one Mitsuki? Why?

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.660
That's enough!
Come back to your senses!

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.030
<i>Hi, thanks for</i>
<i>waiting everybody.</i>

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.530
<i>It's finally time for</i>
<i>Full Moon to come out!</i>

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.560
Mitsuki.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.500
Um, I'm Meroko.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:00.460
Then the one over there
is the real Mitsuki.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.660
Okay, keep on heading
towards the stage.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.800
After that,
we'll do something about it.

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:06.900
But...

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.400
Don't worry. Trust me.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.360
We'll change the stage direction!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.760
Full Moon will appear first and
we'll call her off using the horse.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.500
<i>At this point,</i>
<i>I don't care what happens!</i>

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:25.860
What?! You brought her
up on stage?!

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:28.560
Yeah, we'll switch the two on stage.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.000
What the—?
How are you going to do that?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.830
Not only is Izumi around,
there are the eyes of the crowd!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.130
That's why we'll change
the stage direction a little.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.830
The point is to not have
that moment be visible.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:42.130
We'll do the final trick for
the song in the beginning.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:46.000
You're right, if we do that,
the top of the stage will be hidden.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:50.160
Now Takuto, I have one thing
I have to ask you to do.

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:51.200
Me?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.160
Yes.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:53.860
Will you do it?

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:55.430
Yeah!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.630
<i>Full Moon, are you feeling well?</i>

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.030
<i>Yes, I'm completely fine!</i>

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.060
I'm so glad!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.460
Thanks!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.960
<i>Your new single really captures</i>
<i>your essence.</i>

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.500
<i>Thank you!</i>

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.530
<i>- I did my best!</i>
- She looks distressed. This is great.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.800
<i>Then Full Moon,</i>
<i>please let us hear the song!</i>

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:14.830
<i>Sure.</i>

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.460
All right, let the emcee retire stage left.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:24.030
The song will begin with my signal.
Mitsuki, you got it?

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:24.930
Yes!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.000
All right. Now, let's begin!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:33.030
<i>Now everybody,</i>
<i>please listen to "Eternal Snow."</i>

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.600
- Huh?
-She's so cute!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.160
<i>Mitsuki?</i>

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:40.500
What are they trying to do?

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.200
They won't be able to do a thing.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.130
Now!

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.330
I can't see!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.730
W-What is this?!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.060
Meroko! Now, while we
have the chance!

00:18:59.100 --> 00:18:59.760
Huh?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.660
Takuto!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.530
Meroko! Hurry!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.230
Yeah!

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.100
Done!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:37.300
Darn, I can't see a thing.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:06.230
<i>How long...has it been...</i>
<i>since I fell in love with you...</i>

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:15.830
<i>My feelings keep</i>
<i>getting stronger...</i>

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.230
I'm so tired!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:19.300
Good work!

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:26.000
Umm... Hey, Izumi?

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.530
Sorry, sorry, I might have played
around too much.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:31.400
What?

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.930
Well, Full Moon is a good singer.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.530
I understand why you want
to support her, Takuto.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:42.830
I was able to meet Mitsuki, and there seems
to be nothing suspicious either, so...

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:44.460
What?! Then...

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.830
It's about time we go home.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:50.000
It was fun, Mero!

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:54.800
See you later!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.830
Aren't you glad they
didn't find out, Takuto?

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:03.530
Yeah...

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.900
<i>I hope that's the case.</i>

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:14.060
Izumi, should we report it
to the Division Chief?

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.800
No. For now, I'll be silent about it.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.200
Becoming a friend with
a human child like that.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.660
That's why you'll
always be no good.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:31.100
Before long, I'll make you
understand that Mero is mine.

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.260
Meroko, you said she has
a guest from America?

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:09.930
Who is it?
Could it be Eichi?!

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:14.600
No, it's not! It's Ms. Kazumi,
her teacher from the orphanage.

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:16.160
I see.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:20.030
But Ms. Kazumi's married and
lives in America now!

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:22.700
She might know something about Eichi!

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:26.330
I-I'm just worried about
our assignment as Death Spirits.

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:27.960
It's not like I'm jealous.

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:31.760
Next time on Full Moon:
"Someone Who Might
Know Where Eichi Is"

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:33.030
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
